<title>HUNGARY: C. Europe's CESI index rises one percent.</title>
<headline>C. Europe's CESI index rises one percent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index firmed 14.68 points or 1.03 percent on Thursday to close at 1,438.69 points, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
